pr_body:
This commit adds the ability to gather more than one inner_hit when searching nested kNN.

# Global kNN example

```
POST test/_search
{
    "_source": false,
    "fields": [
        "name"
    ],
    "knn": {
        "field": "nested.vector",
        "query_vector": [
            -0.5,
            90,
            -10,
            14.8,
            -156
        ],
        "k": 3,
        "num_candidates": 3,
        "inner_hits": {
            "size": 2,
            "fields": [
                "nested.paragraph_id"
            ],
            "_source": false
        }
    }
}
```
Results in

